{{Quote|You can't be so stupid as to think this will be easy. My troops will storm this block and kill you all. Whatever you're planning, it won't work.|Phasma, to Finn, after disabling Starkiller Base's shields|<ref name="TFA novel">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens (novelization)|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' novelization]]</ref>}}
'''Command center''' was a location on [[Starkiller Base]].<ref name="Battlefront II" />

It consisted of a massive facility with a large landing platform with a large podium with massive red flags with the First Order emblem on it. It served as the command center and announcement area of Starkiller Base. 

